issue_body:
In PS 1.7.6.1 the email subject and template variable {shop_name} display the internal BO name from the "Multishop" settings. It should display the external name from "Contact" settings.

I patched /classes/Mail.php as follows:

```
//BEGIN PATCH
//            $subject = '[' . $shop->name . '] ' . $subject;
            $subject = '[' . Tools::safeOutput(Configuration::get('PS_SHOP_NAME', null, null, $id_shop)) . '] ' . $subject;
//END PATCH
```
and
```
//BEGIN PATCH
//            $templateVars['{shop_name}'] = Tools::safeOutput($shop->name);
            $templateVars['{shop_name}'] = Tools::safeOutput(Configuration::get('PS_SHOP_NAME', null, null, $id_shop));
//END PATCH
```

Hi
if you pass the mouse over a product block when there are some flags on the image, it is not possible to click over the image.
It is due from this code in theme.css

`.product-flags {
    width: 100%;
}`

to fix it it is necessary to use this code

`.product-flags {
    width: auto;
}`

bye

